    (:milestone
      :id "M06"
      :title "Substrate De-Bloat, Static Whitelisting, and Milestone Governance"
      :epoch "Sovereign Consolidation"
      :waves "Wave 73 - Wave 75"
      :status :settled
      :goals [
        "Completely eradicate netcat (nc -U) from CLI dispatcher in favor of non-blocking socket probes"
        "Purge legacy Node.js and powershell fallbacks, reinforcing pure ASL/Python substrate"
        "Prune watchdog ghost architecture to pure timeout ceilings and STDIN redirection"
        "Institutionalize audit discoveries, enforce static binary whitelisting, and codify milestone retrospectives"
      ]
      :context "Accumulated shell hacks, ghost architecture remnants from prior deadlocks, and unregistered binary invocations introduced latency and reliability hazards."
      :findings [
        "Direct socket probes with 50ms timeouts eliminated 2-second netcat delays and macOS sandbox failures"
        "Strict binary whitelisting (python3, git, bash) in .asl.config.asn guarantees predictable runtime boundaries"
        "Conceptual milestone ledgers provide high-level visibility that prevents task-level myopia"
      ]
      :decisions ["Adr0066" "Adr0067" "Adr0068" "Adr0069"]
      :retrospective [
        "What worked: Eradication of legacy runtime branches restored crisp interactive responsiveness"
        "Friction encountered: Unclosed bash conditional blocks during dead code removal caused syntax errors"
        "Lesson learned: Automated bash -n syntax checks in verification gates prevent syntax regressions"
      ]
      :receipts ["rc-gap-046" "rc-gap-047"])

